config BENCHMARK_FIVELOOP
	bool "fiveloop: five-stage closed-loop fusion benchmark (ECoS PR5)"
	default n
	---help---
		K-Fusion closed-loop workload: sample -> fir -> pid -> clamp -> plant,
		with the feedback edge closing across period boundaries (z^-1).
		Runs the r/s/f probe contract at 1 kHz.  Modes:
		  fiveloop plan <cycles>   one release per period (fused)
		  fiveloop flat <cycles>   one release per stage (A/B control)
		  fiveloop shmwait         poll IVSHMEM for plan/flat commands
		Init uses ecos_boot_main so shmwait runs even without a serial
		console.  The FNV-1a digest must be identical for plan and flat.
